      "html": "<section class=\"ds-frame\"><div class=\"ds-workspace\"><div class=\"ds-composer\"><h2>Give it a second look.</h2><p>Paste a message, or explore a sample.</p></div><aside class=\"ds-analysis\"><span>Analysis</span><p>Ready when you are</p></aside></div></section>",
